   - "check the remaining work and finish up this session pi --session 019fd266-5bb7-70ae-8080-8bd9e678201e"
   - "did we ship the current branch behaviors-executors in this context? also explain 3 to me we don't need hacky stuff"
   - "explain i don't fully understand the decisions"
   - "that silent model change is not reliable"
   - "maybe under the agent settings we can fallback but what's the system keys are you referring to? the admin needs to set the models that can fallback to each other no"

